{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Do not convert MDC snapshot failures into terminal workflow failures.** A transient or custom MDC adapter failure occurs before any handler or plugin code runs, yet `finishFailure` records it as the durable execution result, preventing a clean invocation retry. Treat MDC capture as best-effort with an empty baseline, or propagate it as a retryable invocation-level failure without checkpointing a terminal output.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77yjVd","finding_digest":"0133ad3d67132cc709d324b4bff21ae1d7ecb80233125efebfc5cabeb0237650","finding_id":"arf_v1_aez22plhcmwmocotes2l74q24h","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::supplyhandler::mdc-capture-failure-classification","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::supplyhandler::mdc-capture-failure-classification","line":293,"observation_digest":"773d925172928dd521e1680dca5f5514efd251a2da2877a92c323a58b538daf8","observation_id":"aro_v1_o46zeulsskg5kipbnag4ux2vct","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_aez22plhcmwmocotes2l74q24h","published_at":"2026-10-08T21:30:02Z","review_id":"arr_v1_povxmdcloccfgct74pwuugcyxz","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"18d4e3c9937570ae7a3618bb4830be440021e816","reviewer":"codex","start_line":292,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_ne4olx5crdqr3v72obl7cptj2m","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T21:30:02Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
